// Consumables batch C1 (Scrap Mechanic parity, consumables map): the produce, the four seeds, Chemical and Gasoline,
// moved here from survival.json. The wiki's stats (1.5 kg per weight bar; durability = bars; friction and buoyancy =
// bars / 10; flammable and stack size as the wiki) and the Food page's heals (properties.health, read by food.lua).
// Gasoline keeps 20 kg (a 2x2x2 can). Chemical is made by emptying a Chemical Bucket at the Fabricator: the recipe's
// second output gives the empty Water Bucket back.
// Batch C2b: Bloom Tea and Grazer Shake are drinks (properties.drink: the drink clip and sound, and the player may
// sprint while drinking), found as loot only. Fertilizer is used on a growing crop: properties.boost multiplies its
// growth until harvest (soil.lua; it still needs water). properties.eat_seconds is how long one eat or drink takes.
// Batch C3: Grazer Milk is a drink a tame Grazer gives (bots/grazer.json tame.produce: 5 carrots from its Feeding Trough,
// then Use on it); Grazer Steak is not edible, a cooking input that Grazers drop (bots/grazer.json drops).
// Batch C4: the Field Kitchen (parts_stations.json) cooks the Garden Burger (4 Carrot + 2 Tomato + 10 Potato, 10 s) and the
// Colony Burger (1 Grazer Steak + 5 Tomato + 10 Potato, 13 s), the 3200 recipe group; both heal 30 (perks come later).
// The Potato is no longer edible: ammo and a cooking input.
// Crops batch K1 (crops map): the four seeds take the wiki's seed stats (3/2/4/3/Y, stack 20: 4.5 kg) and grow in
// 1260 s (0.875 of a 1440 s day, as SM). Harvests keep our yields (2 carrots, tomatoes, cotton) except Potato, 10 as SM;
// 1 to 3 seeds back (farmed Cotton exactly 1). Raid values: Cotton 0, Potato and Tomato 1, Carrot 2. seed.thirst
// (soil.lua; default 1) is seconds of water one second of growth uses; one Water Bucket (1260 s) grows one crop.
// Crops batch K2: the Pigment Flower (tools/food/build_pigment_flower.py), our own flower whose petals are the Paint Tool's
// colours: not food, 6 kg, stack 20, the Paint Ammo input (survival.json). Its seed grows in 1260 s like the others and
// gives 2 flowers (our yields) and exactly 1 seed back; raid value 0. Wild ones grow in meadows and forests (worldgen.json
// wild_pigment_flower: Use to pick 1 flower, a seed 40 % of the time).
// Crops batch K3 (tools/food/build_crops.py): Beetroot (heals 30), Banana (35) and Chili, the fruit stats and a seed each
// (seed stats, 1260 s, 2 crops and 1 to 3 seeds back; raid values Beetroot 5, Banana and Chili 10). The Chili is a joke
// food: its negative health hurts the eater 50 (food.lua through holder.hurt), even at full health.
// Crops batch K4 (tools/food/build_crops.py): Blueberry (heals 40), Orange (45), Broccoli (50) and Pineapple (55), the fruit
// stats and a seed each (seed stats, 1260 s, 2 crops and 1 to 3 seeds back; raid values Blueberry 31, Orange 61, Broccoli
// 90, Pineapple 161: one of each reaches the raid level SM's would). Broccoli and Pineapple are thirsty (seed.thirst 2:
// two Water Buckets a crop). The Fabricator makes a Grazer Shake from 100 Ice Blocks, 3 Oranges and 1 Grazer Milk (3210).
// Re-run with tools/author-vanilla.sh.
